---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Me | Durmuş Efe Özhan">
  <Header activeNav="about" />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-app px-4 pb-12 pt-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide sm:text-3xl">About Me</h1>
    
    <article id="article" class="prose mx-auto mt-8 max-w-app prose-img:border-0">
      <p>
        Hey there! I'm <strong>Durmuş Efe Özhan</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        I was born in Mersin on June 30, 2005, but I actually live in Muğla. After graduating from Muğla Gazi Anatolian High School in 2023, I started studying <strong>Computer Engineering at Samsun Ondokuz Mayıs University</strong> in 2024, and I'm currently continuing my journey here.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-dashed border-skin-line my-6" />

      <h3>What Am I Working On?</h3>
      <p>
        Rather than sticking to a single field in engineering, I love getting under the hood to see how systems actually work. Driven by the curiosity of <em>"what’s happening behind the scenes?"</em>, I experiment with various technologies and explore what suits me best.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside coding, staying active within developer communities is important to me:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>TEVED (Technology and Productivity Association):</strong> Part of the founding team where we strive to spread technology and productivity practices (<a href="https://teved.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">teved.org</a>).</li>
        <li><strong>GDG Samsun:</strong> Organizing community events and meetups with the Google Developer Groups Samsun team.</li>
        <li><strong>University Clubs:</strong> Actively participating in student clubs and taking part in new projects.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-dashed border-skin-line my-6" />

      <h3>Beyond the Code: Interests & Hobbies</h3>
      <p>
        In short, experiencing and observing new things always gives me a distinct excitement:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Human Psychology & Behavior:</strong> I have a serious curiosity about human psychology; I love understanding behavioral patterns, analyzing people, and reading articles/essays in this domain to gain new perspectives.</li>
        <li><strong>Cinema & TV Series:</strong> I'm an avid viewer. After watching something, I really enjoy reading reviews on Letterboxd, exploring deep analyses, and rating what I've watched.</li>
        <li><strong>Sports:</strong> I actively do fitness training; besides that, I enjoy playing football and basketball, as well as trying out different sports disciplines.</li>
        <li><strong>Kitchen Experiments:</strong> Discovering new recipes, tweaking them to my taste, and coming up with unique flavors is one of my favorite ways to unwind.</li>
        <li><strong>Short-Term Goal:</strong> Alongside software, I want to learn 3D modeling this year to get physical outputs, and dive into electronics to build more tangible, hands-on projects.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-dashed border-skin-line my-6" />

      <h3>What Is This Website, Really?</h3>
      <p>
        This place isn't just a classic portfolio where I showcase finished products; it’s more of my <strong>open-source developer journal</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>Here, I share:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Projects I develop,</li>
        <li>Experiments I enthusiastically started and left half-done—or dropped saying <em>"well, this approach didn't make much sense after all"</em>,</li>
        <li>My latest hands-on trials across hardware, 3D modeling, and software.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-dashed border-skin-line my-6" />

      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-skin-accent pl-4 italic">
        🐾 <strong>A Quick Note (Zuzu):</strong><br />
        If you click and pet the little tuxedo cat following you around as you browse the site, that’s <strong>Zuzu</strong>—my own cat, born on August 13, 2021. I wanted him to keep you company while you explore!
      </blockquote>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>